# Copy to .env and fill in, then `export $(grep -v '^#' .env | xargs)` before
# running, or use any dotenv loader / your shell's own env var mechanism.
# CLI flags always override these; these override config.yaml.
#
# On a shared HPC filesystem: `chmod 600 .env`, never commit it, and never put
# real keys in a script that's checked into git or world-readable. See
# docs/HPC_SETUP.md for the full secure-storage walkthrough.

# One Perplexity API key drives BOTH reviewer roles. Get one at
# https://console.perplexity.ai (separate from your Perplexity account /
# Computer credits -- see docs/HPC_SETUP.md).
PERPLEXITY_API_KEY=
PERPLEXITY_CLAUDE_MODEL=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5-5
PERPLEXITY_SECOND_MODEL=openai/gpt-5.5

# ---- Optional: sampling controls (both reviewer roles) ----
# Left unset by default (API default, currently 1.0). Lower (e.g. 0) reduces
# -- but does not eliminate -- run-to-run variance in the recommendation.
# TITAN_CURATE_TEMPERATURE=0

# minimal|low|medium|high|xhigh. Lower effort cuts reasoning-token spend
# substantially (the dominant driver of output-token cost on this endpoint)
# at the cost of potentially shallower analysis.
# TITAN_CURATE_REASONING_EFFORT=low
